{"id":"befreien","lemma":"befreien","pos":"verb","rank":1557,"glosses":["to free (make free), to liberate","to escape"],"ipa":"/bəˈfʁaɪ̯ən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/47/De-befreien.ogg/De-befreien.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"befreie","1p":"befreien","2s":"befreist","2p":"befreit","3s":"befreit","3p":"befreien"},"preterite":{"1s":"befreite","1p":"befreiten","2s":"befreitest","2p":"befreitet","3s":"befreite","3p":"befreiten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe befreit","1p":"haben befreit","2s":"hast befreit","2p":"habt befreit","3s":"hat befreit","3p":"haben befreit"},"future":{"1s":"werde befreien","1p":"werden befreien","2s":"wirst befreien","2p":"werdet befreien","3s":"wird befreien","3p":"werden befreien"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"befrei","2p":"befreit"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde befreien","1p":"würden befreien","2s":"würdest befreien","2p":"würdet befreien","3s":"würde befreien","3p":"würden befreien"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"befreit"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich werde die Gefangenen befreien.","en":"I'm releasing the prisoners.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"caught","l":"gefangen"},null]},{"text":"Sie befreiten den Gefangenen.","en":"They freed the prisoner.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"caught","l":"gefangen"}]},{"text":"Befreit die Tiere aus den Käfigen!","en":"Free the animals from their cages.","words":[null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"animal","l":"Tier"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"cage","l":"Käfig"}]},{"text":"Er will, dass wir die Gefangenen befreien.","en":"He wants us to free the prisoners.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"caught","l":"gefangen"},null]},{"text":"Tom befreite sich.","en":"Tom broke free.","words":[null,null,{"g":"oneself"}]}]}